<p>Forces a creature to appear on the player's minimap as a blue dot. This can be used to highlight non-hostile creatures of interest, such as NPCs that are fighting alongside your party.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Void%20keyword" title="Void keyword">void</a> ShowAsAllyOnMap(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oCreature,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bEnable<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oCreature<dd>The creature to show on the map<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bEnable<dd>TRUE to make the creature appear on the map, and FALSE to hide it
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Nothing.
